01:08:33.097 --> 01:08:35.620
You need to exercise, get off your butt.

01:08:35.620 --> 01:08:37.860
Cold, heat and hyperbaric.

01:08:37.860 --> 01:08:38.693
- Yeah.

01:08:38.693 --> 01:08:39.600
Well, as I mentioned,

01:08:39.600 --> 01:08:41.870
I used to do and I will do again

01:08:41.870 --> 01:08:43.670
