one day of the week.

01:08:46.960 --> 01:08:49.460
This was on a Sunday with my son Benjamin.

01:08:49.460 --> 01:08:50.880
But I would say more is better.

01:08:50.880 --> 01:08:53.130
There's no evidence that
you can overdo this,

01:08:54.030 --> 01:08:55.530
you could even do it every day.

01:08:55.530 --> 01:08:57.370
If you don't have access to a gym,

01:08:57.370 --> 01:08:59.340
you can always use your house;

01:08:59.340 --> 01:09:01.450
